From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <muthukumardce@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 22:41:50 +0530
Subject: Migrate all ForBinding hooks to native paths for zero timing overhead
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Eliminate ~80+ ForBinding (ImplementedAs=*ForBinding) hooks across Blink
renderer that were detectable by Cloudflare and similar bot-detection
systems due to the timing overhead of the CallWith=ScriptState IDL
pattern. All fingerprint override logic now uses the lock-free
GetFallbackStorageFast() native path directly in original Chromium
methods.

Migration pattern applied to each API:
  1. Remove [CallWith=ScriptState] from IDL attribute
  2. Remove [ImplementedAs=*ForBinding] from IDL attribute
  3. Remove ForBinding method declaration from .h
  4. Move override logic into original method using GetFallbackStorageFast()
  5. Remove ForBinding method body from .cc

Categories migrated:
  - Canvas: toDataURL, toBlob, getImageData (HTMLCanvasElement, OffscreenCanvas)
  - WebGL: getParameter, getSupportedExtensions, getExtension, readPixels,
    getShaderPrecisionFormat (WebGLRenderingContextBase, WebGL2RenderingContextBase)
  - Audio: AnalyserNode, AudioBuffer, AudioContext, DynamicsCompressorNode,
    OfflineAudioContext
  - DOM Geometry: Element.getBoundingClientRect, getClientRects,
    clientLeft/Top/Width/Height, scrollWidth/Height
  - Range Geometry: getBoundingClientRect, getClientRects
  - SVG Geometry: getTotalLength, getPointAtLength, getScreenCTM, getBBox,
    getComputedTextLength
  - Performance: now(), timeOrigin, getEntries*, mark, measure, toJSON
  - Event: timeStamp
  - IntersectionObserver: boundingClientRect, intersectionRect, rootBounds,
    intersectionRatio
  - HTML Offsets: offsetLeft/Top/Width/Height
  - Plugins: navigator.plugins, navigator.mimeTypes
  - doNotTrack: navigator.doNotTrack, window.doNotTrack
  - Speech: getVoices, pending, speaking, paused
  - Geolocation: getCurrentPosition, watchPosition, clearWatch
  - MediaStream: getCapabilities, getSettings
  - MediaDevices: enumerateDevices, getUserMedia, getDisplayMedia
  - Vibration: vibrate
  - Gamepad: getGamepads
  - Notifications: Notification properties
  - RTCPeerConnection: createOffer, createAnswer, getStats, etc.
  - ServiceWorker: register, getRegistration, getRegistrations
  - CacheStorage: open, keys, has, delete, match
  - Font Loading: FontFace.load, FontFaceSet.load/add/check/delete/has/clear
  - Form Autocomplete: autocomplete on input/form/select/textarea
  - History: history.length
  - CSS: getComputedStyle, matchMedia, getPropertyValue, CSS.supports
  - ScreenOrientation: type, angle

Additional fixes:
  - Fix NavigatorUAData cache invalidation: always refresh metadata from
    GetUserAgentMetadata() on each access while maintaining stable JS
    object identity (===). This ensures fingerprint config updates via
    SyncRendererPrefs() are reflected without requiring navigation.
  - Revert incorrect ScriptState* additions to WebGLRenderingContextWebGPUBase
    methods (getShaderPrecisionFormat, getSupportedExtensions, readPixels x3,
    getBufferSubData) — these are Chromium's WebGPU bridge methods, not
    fingerprint override targets.

193 files changed, 1060 insertions, 2626 deletions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

